{"id": "unknown-2026-11-13-011", "date": "2026-11-13", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 46, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["oled_penetration"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Some users of Apple's new OLED MacBook Pro report eye strain and dizziness, blame the display's 240Hz PWM dimming", "content": "<p>Apple started shipping its <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/apple-announces-its-first-oled-laptop-macbook-pro-proled-xdr-display\">first OLED laptop, the MacBook Pro with PROLED XDR Display</a>, on November 6, and some early buyers already report that using it causes eye strain, headaches and dizziness.</p><p><img class=\"align-center\" src=\"https://www.oled-info.com/sites/default/files/inline-images/Apple-MacBook-Pro-PROLED-XDR.jpg\" alt=\"Apple MacBook Pro with PROLED XDR OLED display\" width=\"", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/some-users-apples-new-oled-macbook-pro-report-eye-strain-and-dizziness-blame", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-11-13-012", "date": "2026-11-13", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 46, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.75, "reasons": ["涉及財報"]}, "title": "Commentary: From industry definer to industry participant? Nvidia's 2035 outlook in post-Jensen Huang Era", "content": "When Jensen Huang's resignation took effect on November 12, most of the market's attention turned to who would be Nvidia's next CEO. However, a better starting point for judging what Nvidia will look like a decade from now is to ask the reverse question: had Huang stayed on, what kind of company would Nvidia have become by 2035? The gap between that original blueprint and the new reality is the true cost of his departure.", "sources": [{"name": "digitimes_display", "url": "https://www.digitimes.com/news/a20261113VL234/2035-nvidia-jensen-huang-ai-outlook.html", "type": "rss"}]}
